    "description": "US marks 15 years of American Corner Jaffna; expands engagement with \u2018Freedom 250 Pavilion\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/US-marks-15-years-of-American-Corner-Jaffna-expands-engagement-with-Freedom-250-Pavilion/56-791279",
    "lang": "en",
