    "chunk_text": "Singhagiri makes history with Sri Lanka\u2019s first-ever Hisense 116\u201d RGB MiniLED TV\n\nIn a landmark move for the Sri Lankan consumer electronics market, Singhagiri, the nation\u2019s trusted home for premium appliances and electronics and the exclusive distributor of Hisense, proudly announces the pioneering launch of the revolutionary Hisense RGB Mini LED 116 television. This signifies a technological leap forward, establishing Singhagiri as the first and only retailer in Sri Lanka to bring groundbreaking RGB-Mini LED technology directly to consumers.\n\nBeyond the typical specifications, this launch by Singhagiri paves the way for the company to redefine home entertainment by delivering meaningful innovation by Hisense. At the core of this achievement stands the mass-production of the RGB Mini LED 116, a feat first accomplished globally by Hisense. This proprietary technology utilizes individual red, green, and blue Mini-LEDs across thousands of dimming zones, which is a significant advancement over conventional single-color LED backlights.\n\nFor the Sri Lankan viewer, this translates into an experience that genuinely stands apart. The benefits are tangible: breathtaking colour purity achieving up to 95% of the cinema-grade BT.2020 colour space, an extraordinary peak brightness of 8,000 nits for dazzling highlights, and a remarkable over 20% reduction in power consumption. This means unparalleled realism, with every sunset appearing vividly true-to-life and every night scene that would appear packed with detail, all while being more energy efficient.\n\nThe massive 116-inch display of the RGB Mini-LED TV is designed to transform your living room into a personal theatre, to make you feel the roar of a stadium during a live match, or get lost in the epic sweep of a film, or dive headfirst into immersive gaming. The experience is intelligently powered by the Hi-View AI Engine X, which optimizes picture and sound in real time for any content."
  },
