    "description": "Govt. widens VAT net: new Bill cuts threshold, taxes digital services, raises financial sector levy",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Govt-widens-VAT-net-new-Bill-cuts-threshold-taxes-digital-services-raises-financial-sector-levy/34-791395",
