    "description": "Rs. 13 b lost \u2014  What the Central Bank\u2019s circular really reveals",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Rs-13-b-lost-What-the-Central-Bank-s-circular-really-reveals/14-791450",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
