    "chunk_size_bytes": 1755,
    "chunk_text": "Autobahn Traders embraces digital strategy to optimize customer service\n\nAutobahn Traders (Pvt) Ltd, a respected name in the import and distribution of brand-new BMW vehicle spare parts, has embraced a digital-first transformation strategy to enhance operational efficiency and deliver optimized customer care and service to fleet owners and individual customers in this discerning segment.\n\nNow in its 8th year as a trusted partner in automotive spare parts, Autobahn Traders has achieved a rapid, oneyear rollout of the Odoo ERP system. This implementation boosts efficiency and inventory accuracy, two essential pillars for serving BMW workshops, garage owners, and passionate BMW vehicle owners. The parts are imported through authorized channels from different parts of the world, including Germany, the UK, Turkey, Singapore, India, China, Malaysia, etc\n\n\u201cOur strategy to pursue a digital-first transformation reflects our commitment to always providing the best services to our customers. Given the complexity of auto spare parts, real-time, accurate part identification, availability, and cost-reflective competitive price communication are considered extremely important in our line of trade. Hence, the deployment of the ERP system to facilitate the transformation was critical to maintaining our service levels at a time of growth,\u201d said Ushlah Aluthge, Operations Director, Autobahn Traders (Pvt) Ltd.\n\nAs stated by the Managing Director, Hasith Senarathne, to further enhance the value of the transformation in terms of process efficiency and productivity, Autobahn Traders (Pvt) Ltd will complete the implementation of the 5S methodology over the next three months and is already working towards ISO certification for quality excellence."
