    "chunk_text": "Viet Nam President here on State visit tomorrow\n\nThe President of the Socialist Republic of Viet Nam and the General Secretary of the Communist Party of Viet Nam T\u00f4 L\u00e2m will undertake a State visit to Sri Lanka from tomorrow 7 to 8 May 2026.\n\nThe visit takes place at the invitation of President Anura Kumara Dissanayake following his State visit to Viet Nam in 2025 to commemorate the 55th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between Sri Lanka and Viet Nam.\n\nDuring the visit, the two leaders will hold bilateral talks on a range of matters of mutual interest. The President of Viet Nam will also take part in a series of high-level engagements including the inauguration of the \u201cSri Lanka \u2013 Viet Nam Trade, Investment and Tourism Forum\u201d.\n\nPresident T\u00f4 L\u00e2m will be accompanied on the visit by senior ministers of the Government and prominent political leaders, including the Secretary of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Viet Nam."
