    "md5": "3c2b82bef173bee74cac63c81381ee28",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 984,
    "chunk_text": "Exfoliation with Natural Scrubs\n\nThought of giving my readers something different this week \u2013 exfoliation with natural scrubs.\n\nGently massage in circular motions for 02\u201303 minutes, and then rinse with lukewarm water.\n\nMassage hair and scalp with argan, olive, or black seed oil.\n\nLeave for 30 minutes, or overnight, and then wash with a gentle shampoo.\n\nYou can do it with Honey and Yoghurt: Moisturizing and brightening, and also with Turmeric and Milk: Reduces blemishes and inflammation.\n\nMix the ingredients (either honey and yoghurt or turmeric and milk) to a paste and apply evenly.\n\nLeave for 10\u201315 minutes, and then rinse gently with warm water.\n\nInclude dates, almonds, honey, figs, and olive oil in your diet.\n\nDrink plenty of water and herbal teas (like chamomile or sage).\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
