    "description": "The $ 2.5 m disconnect: Systems transition, national confusion, and future of debt management",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/The-2-5-m-disconnect-Systems-transition-national-confusion-and-future-of-debt-management/4-791609",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
