    "date_str": "2026-05-09",
    "description": "From oil shocks to green power: China\u2019s strategic edge in an uncertain world",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-oil-shocks-to-green-power-China-s-strategic-edge-in-an-uncertain-world/4-791683",
